  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 FAQs\n\n### Why can&#39;t I see my users in Capium 365? - Adding a User\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Sep, 2025 at 10:44 AM\n\n\t\tCapium 365 - Users\n\nNavigation: Capium Home > 'C' icon > Capium 365 > Manage\n\nUsers will appear in Manage > Users once they’ve accessed the Capium 365 module. To do this, they just need to click the ‘C’ icon at the top and open the Capium 365 module at least once. After that, they will automatically be added to the Users list.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
